%%{init: {'theme': 'base'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    title Pipeline Locking Mechanism (Local-Only)

    Note right of Worker: Local-Only Deployment (ADR-010):<br/>Используется MemoryLock для локального<br/>процесса. Redis-блокировки отложены<br/>для будущего распределённого развёртывания.

    participant Worker as Pipeline Worker
    participant LockManager as MemoryLock (In-Process)
    participant Lake as Data Lake (Local FS)

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Worker,Lake: == Incremental Run ==
        Worker->>LockManager: acquire("lock:chembl_activity")
        alt Lock acquired successfully
            LockManager-->>Worker: Lock granted
            Worker->>Lake: Write Bronze/Silver/Gold
            Worker->>LockManager: release()
        else Lock is already held
            LockManager-->>Worker: Lock denied (another pipeline running)
            Worker->>Worker: Abort with error
        end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 250, 240)
        Note over Worker,Lake: == Exclusive Run (Backfill/Rebuild) ==
        Worker->>LockManager: acquire("lock:chembl_activity:exclusive")
        alt Lock acquired
            LockManager-->>Worker: Exclusive lock granted
            Worker->>Lake: Clear & rebuild data
            Worker->>LockManager: release()
        else Active incremental lock exists
            LockManager-->>Worker: Lock denied
            Worker->>Worker: Wait or abort
        end
    end

    Note over Worker,Lake: Lock Max Duration: 4 hours<br/>После истечения - принудительное снятие
